 "description": "<p>A five-piece bridal set in polyester: veil, top, panties, leg loops, and sleeves, in white or black, one size for 40-60 kg. The leg loops take the garter role, and the sleeves add the formality that strapless versions skip.</p>\n<p>White and black versions share the cut. White plays the wedding-night theme directly; black makes it a costume statement that works past the honeymoon context.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: veil, top, panties, leg loops, sleeves</li>\n<li>Style: bridal</li>\n<li>Color: white or black</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Five pieces in either colorway, and the veil works for photos in both.</p>\n",
